        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-02",
          "text": "After the morning post.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-02",
          "text": "Take this copy to Kiva. If she needs a return address, offer ours.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-03",
          "text": "Kiva. Blue awning, west court.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-03",
          "text": "ArenI will start with hello.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-06",
          "text": "Rusk sent us.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-06",
          "text": "KivaDid he finally fit those hinges?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-07",
          "text": "A commission with my own mark. If my answer misses the noon packet, they ask the next maker.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-08",
          "text": "This came with Lower Post\u2019s answer. It names Bell Basin too.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-09",
          "text": "Closed? I opened at six.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-10",
          "text": "They need a return address for the acknowledgment. The post will not accept mine.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-11",
          "text": "Use Lower Post. Ossa offered.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-11",
          "text": "KivaAnd you will bring their answer?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-11",
          "text": "ArenI will bring it here.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-12",
          "text": "The crate pays more. It takes a barrow down the ramp.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-13",
          "text": "I\u2019m saving for a room. Can the hinges wait until tomorrow?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-13",
          "text": "KivaThe brass can. My answer cannot.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-14",
          "text": "Then the answer goes first.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-14",
          "text": "KivaThe letter fee, on its dispatch receipt.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        }
      ]
